        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Never before have you experienced a hunting game like theHunter: Call of the Wild. Plunge into an atmospheric open world, teeming with life: from the majestic true-to-life animals to the rustling of leaves above you as you stalk your prey. You can decide to hunt on your own or join up and hunt together with friends. Just remember, you are not just a visitor in this world, you are a living and breathing part of it. As you finally spot the majestic crown of your first red deer through the brush, the feeling is indescribable.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Nunca antes has vivido un juego de caza como theHunter: Call of the Wild. Sumérgete en un mundo abierto atmosférico, rebosante de vida: desde animales majestuosos y fieles a la realidad hasta el crujido de las hojas sobre tu cabeza mientras acechas a tu presa. Puedes cazar por tu cuenta o unirte a amigos para cazar en grupo. Recuerda que no eres un simple visitante en este mundo: eres una parte viva y palpitante de él. Cuando por fin divisas entre la maleza la majestuosa cornamenta de tu primer ciervo rojo, la sensación es indescriptible.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2017",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
